axes.local_files:
**No local file-access capability.** The core capability is browser control.
The user profile is persisted by default in the Playwright cache directory (isolated by workspace hash);
--isolated switches it to in-memory only.

axes.background:
The browser process can stay resident. --idle-timeout controls idle shutdown:
**headless closes after 1 hour idle by default; headed mode never closes by default**;
the next tool call relaunches the browser.
